      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"get out of it\"? what does that even mean... like just quit? i cant just quit, i'd be on the street in a week. i mean i know i need a way out, but everything feels so permanent and heavy. it just feels like there's no actual exit that isn't just more struggle.",
